        "body": "Bug-fix release. PyPI: https://pypi.org/project/omicverse/2.4.1/\n\n### Fixes\n- `ov.pp.qc` in `cpu-gpu-mixed` mode raised `NameError: name 'backend' is not defined` on an in-memory AnnData (2.4.0 regression); mixed-mode QC now matches CPU mode exactly (#1032)\n- `remove_ambient(method='envelope')` no longer pinned at the lower clip at low contamination (cross-fitted panel); `panel_gene_map` maps aSMA to ACTA2; a second library of one person no longer breaks `resolve_sample_relationships` (#1030)\n- `ov.pp.scdblfinder` / `qc(doublets_method='scdblfinder')`: expected doublet rate 1% per 1000 cells, as R scDblFinder (#1031)\n\n### Bulk\n- limma from PyPI (`python-limma>=0.1.1`) instead of a vendored copy (#1029)\n\nFull notes: https://github.com/omicverse/omicverse-tutorials/blob/main/docs/Release_notes.md",
